WEBVTT

00:00:00.058 --> 00:00:02.554
The output of this stage can be a small document or

00:00:02.624 --> 00:00:06.687
section: purpose, people, agreed journey,

00:00:07.129 --> 00:00:11.958
constraints, non-goals, verified facts, assumptions,

00:00:12.341 --> 00:00:13.944
and outstanding questions.

00:00:14.385 --> 00:00:18.007
Add a date and a clear status such as agreed or still

00:00:18.053 --> 00:00:18.912
being discussed.

00:00:19.516 --> 00:00:21.536
Keep it accessible to future sessions.

00:00:21.977 --> 00:00:25.356
Later, when the system changes, update or supersede the

00:00:25.414 --> 00:00:28.642
relevant decision rather than rely on someone remembering

00:00:28.676 --> 00:00:29.385
what was said.

00:00:30.081 --> 00:00:32.624
Now you have something concrete enough to research and

00:00:32.659 --> 00:00:33.181
design.
